Package: com.adarsh.wingman
Name: Wingman
Version: 1.7.9
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Personal AI reply assistant for chat and dating apps. A floating bubble captures the chat (dropping the keyboard so earlier messages show), offers 5 editable quick replies per app, or writes 3 AI replies in one of 20 styles (incl. dating/flirt) using Claude or DeepSeek. Reads the chat on-device, remembers dating matches with a name-based gender guess and per-contact notes, and types the reply straight into the message box. API keys now sync across all apps.
Maintainer: Adarsh
Author: Adarsh
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, preferenceloader, com.opa334.altlist
